  "details": "The current sharing pedestal UI makes it a bit difficult to control the position of the pedestal, and requires an unnecessarily wide open area to place pedestals. It also gives no control over vertical position, so you can't place a sharing pedestal on a shelf, for example. Having a UI that is more akin to pickups would be easier to use - and it'd feel a lot better to be able to literally hand a photo over to a friend, too.",
